  "description": "Erection of a first floor side extension, a single storey rear extension including the conversion of the integrated flank garage into habitable rooms, provision of a juliet balcony to first floor rear elevation, alteration to the ground floor front fenestration and provision of a raised rear patio and step leading down to rear garden land.",
